"https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593858738_1747397446279615_3937584290932783368_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L-U5pFW2ACsQ7kNvwF7pyVk&_nc_oc=AdrDUgqKXyzzG6e0oU3CPfU5TvtuUJEyVc5lPF2DGDcsRVQ_Vve9fAdVOIuR75uqwOs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ_Evi4otMW7gyo55oOeit5sBQTQ2bEFnWmcktBDSRlmA&oe=6B01BD71"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-07-28-21h17m47s545.png", "id": "27470374099300173", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673536876_27470374109300172_3318935900093651350_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Byfhg6V314sQ7kNvwGxxv4Y&_nc_oc=Ado0gBUuOYphrJzeQswwt8V1ymz2t9zIOKEZAn9S-RfPnl-Noh9edIbCbMbGDoJAsqE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-gAqHHfOSGrXVB_jj6ADtxOjOujC-iEGEl6-1z84nAA&oe=6B01E95B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled(1)(1).png", "id": "2087130625540636", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_2087130628873969_7866446366568667079_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k38dCeO96NAQ7kNvwGOEwWK&_nc_oc=AdpgFymNmHLLVNBZak0-hl5wO5uhaByIC3oKJK3E0bOD_C3wyMz0DLEnF4W1cL1WOTA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS4w7mo-GjNWu0ne42mB7_zr52Vpj3Lm5zrv4ZR8cNtNw&oe=6B01CE32"}, "display_name": "Web Weaver", "keywords": ["swinging", "web", "parkour", "grapple", "movement"], "long_description": "**WEB WEAVER**\n\nSwing. Flail. Faceplant. Repeat.\n\nGrab a web, launch yourself off a skyscraper, and pray your aim was better than your judgment. Web Weaver is a physics-based web-swinging parkour game where every jump is one bad grip away from glorious disaster - and it's even funnier with friends.\n\n{1590796759424065}\n\n**BRING FRIENDS (IT'S FUNNIER)**\n\n Multiplayer mayhem. Swing together, knock each other off course, race through the city, or just dangle around being menaces. Everything is better with a squad of googly-eyed disasters.\n\n{1566776888280050}\n\n**SWING THROUGH THE CITY**\n\n Fully physics-driven web-swinging. No rails, no autopilot \u2014 just you, your grip, and gravity doing exactly what it wants. Nail a perfect arc between rooftops and feel like a god. Miss by a hair and eat pavement. Both are great.\n\n{1045542848436579}\n\n**DODGE THE CHAOS**\n\n Lasers. Obstacles. Traps that appear right where you were about to grab. The city is actively trying to end you, and the parkour gets meaner the deeper you go.\n\n{2230945841053332}\n\n**Grab a web. Get moving. Try not to scream.**", "short_description": "Physics-based web-swinging parkour. Dodge lasers, chain wild arcs, faceplant gloriously, and cause chaos with friends."}]}, "developer_name": "AP Development", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/babydeathrampage/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AP Publishing", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/babydeathrampage/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "1360651905570840"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2951992098507627"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2186399875555657"}, {"status": "PENDI